 "remarks": "Ideally located within walking distance of downtown Westport, 310 Main Street offers a unique opportunity to enjoy the convenience of in-town living while creating a home that suits your lifestyle. The main level features a living room with a wood-burning fireplace, an open kitchen with granite countertops and dining area, and French doors leading to a private stone patio. A primary suite with en-suite bath and two additional bedrooms complete the main level.  The finished lower level offers additional flexibility, with two potential bedrooms and a full bath, providing options for guests, recreation, or multigenerational living. A two-car garage and private outdoor space add to the appeal. An especially compelling feature is the existing town-approved home occupation setup, with a separate entrance, two offices, and a waiting room-ideal for a professional practice or home-based business (subject to applicable approvals).  Whether you envision updating the existing home to reflect your personal style or exploring the possibility of expanding upon the existing home, 310 Main Street offers versatility, opportunity, and an exceptional location close to Westport's shops, restaurants, and amenities.",
